      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Hoover‑Minthorn House Museum in Newberg showcases life from the town’s early pioneer days.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newberg%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "For much of its early years, Newberg remained a dry town where alcohol could not be sold.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
